{"id": 73, "ts": 1780453980.9404075, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 5, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate James\u2019s clarification that Candidate\u202fC not only makes correct decisions quickly but also stays calm in a crisis. That directly addresses the missing evidence on decision quality and stress resilience\u2014two of the most safety\u2011critical criteria for long\u2011distance pilots. Combined with C\u2019s 100\u202f% reliability and the fact that he creates a positive crew atmosphere, these strengths now outweigh the concerns about his communication style and limited appetite for further education. While Candidate\u202fA shows strong anticipation and leadership, we still lack concrete evidence of his performance under pressure, and his difficulty accepting criticism could impair crew cooperation. Given the new data, I\u2019m moving my provisional vote to Candidate\u202fC as the best overall fit at this stage."}
